WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.211
Another sign-in. Another reach for your phone.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:09.585
Meet Keyrook Authenticator: your two-factor codes, right in your browser.

00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:14.084
On a sign-in page, one click fills the code for you.

00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:20.727
Or skip the popup altogether: Alt, Shift, F.

00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:27.749
Setting up a new account? It reads the QR code straight off the page.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:36.223
Coming from Google Authenticator? Hold your phone up to the webcam, and everything moves across.

00:00:37.373 --> 00:00:42.135
Or bring your accounts over from Aegis, Bitwarden, Proton, and more.

00:00:43.373 --> 00:00:50.768
Sync every browser with Google, GitHub or email — end-to-end encrypted, so even our server can’t read a thing.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:55.199
And a new browser only gets in when you say so.

00:00:56.818 --> 00:00:58.945
It speaks fifty languages.

00:01:02.018 --> 00:01:05.462
Just need one code? Paste the key, and there it is.

00:01:06.818 --> 00:01:11.231
Everything is encrypted on your device, and it never reads the sites you visit.

00:01:12.381 --> 00:01:15.705
And if you ever move on, every account comes with you.

00:01:17.781 --> 00:01:21.379
Keyrook Authenticator. Free for Chrome and Edge.
